    <string name="how_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="how_text">Each training is minutes × how hard it felt (1–10). It feeds its element\'s spirit and fades over about two weeks. The island\'s height is the average of all five; an imbalance shows as weather: drought, landslides, gusts, cracks.</string>
    <string name="how_text2">A storm means the load jumped too fast compared with the last four weeks (the acute-to-chronic ratio). It\'s a nudge to rest, not a punishment. While at anchor, nothing fades.</string>
