    <string name="about">About</string>
    <string name="about_text">A training log where five elemental spirits keep your island in the sky. No accounts, no ads; everything stays on the phone.</string>
    <string name="credits">Font m6x11 by Daniel Linssen, Cyrillic by Natto Games. Weather: Open-Meteo.com and MET Norway (CC BY 4.0). The load model is general advice, not medical advice.</string>
    <string name="ob_1">This island floats above the clouds. Five spirits hold it up, and your training gives them strength.</string>
    <string name="ob_1b">Log a training and a light flies to its spirit. The more evenly you train, the higher the island rises and the more grows on it.</string>
    <string name="ob_2">Every kind of training feeds one element.</string>
    <string name="ob_2b">Your own kinds of training can be added and given to any spirit.</string>
    <string name="ob_3">Where are you? With a town, the island sees the real weather, and rare guests fly in for training in rain, snow or frost.</string>
    <string name="ob_3b">Optional: without a town, mark the weather by hand.</string>
